    "上がった順に 大富豪・富豪・貧民・大貧民。次のゲームは 大貧民→大富豪 に強い2枚、大富豪→大貧民 に弱い2枚（富豪と貧民は1枚ずつ）を渡します" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Players are ranked Tycoon, Rich, Poor, and Beggar in the order they go out. Before the next game, the Beggar gives the Tycoon their 2 strongest cards, and the Tycoon gives the Beggar 2 weak cards (the Rich and the Poor swap 1 card each)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今のゲームを打ち切ります。あなたは大貧民になり、負けとして記録されます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This ends the current game. You'll become the Beggar, and it will count as a loss."
          }
        }
      }
    },
