        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the same suit is played twice in a row, only that suit (and Jokers) can be played until the field clears (off by default)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じスートで数が連なる3枚以上（例: ♠5-6-7）を1つの組として出せます。強さは一番強い札で比べ、場と同じ枚数の階段だけで受けます。ジョーカーは欠けた数の代わりになります（初期設定はなし）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Three or more consecutive cards of one suit (e.g. ♠5-6-7) can be played as one set. Runs are compared by their strongest card and can only be answered by a run of the same length. A Joker can stand in for a missing number (off by default)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ柄の連番3枚以上を出せる" : {
